@startuml
title FríoTrack — modelo lógico del cliente integrado
class WorkspaceRepository <<module>> {
  +data: Ref<WorkspaceData>
  +profile: Ref<Profile?>
  +login(draft): Promise<Profile>
  +register(draft): Promise<Profile>
  +logout(): Promise<void>
  +execute(type, payload): Promise<Object>
  +restoreSession(): Promise<void>
  -request(path, body): Promise<Object>
}
class WorkspaceData <<logical object>> {
  +schema: Number
  +revision: Number
  +profiles: Profile[]
  +vehicles: Vehicle[]
  +drivers: Driver[]
  +shipments: Shipment[]
  +alerts: Alert[]
  +notifications: Notification[]
}
class DomainOperations <<module>>
class WorkspaceStore <<server service>>
WorkspaceRepository --> WorkspaceData : updates reactive state
WorkspaceRepository ..> WorkspaceStore : HTTPS JSON and bearer token
WorkspaceStore --> WorkspaceData : filters by actor
note bottom
Logical representation of modules and data objects.
The server validates permissions and persists private JSON.
end note
@enduml
